Conclusion: none of 3 fresh, independent full-search runs reproduced the
committed GROUP_SIZE_M=1 result at this M. BLOCK_SIZE_M/N/K and num_warps
were stable across all 4 data points (committed + 3 fresh); only
GROUP_SIZE_M and num_stages varied.

Caveat (this first attempt only -- see "second attempt" below for the
fully-saved rerun): only gate_up_proj's M=1024 entry was captured from
each run before the k8s Job was deleted (to free the GPU) -- the other 4
shapes' results from these 3 runs, and run 3's shapes 2-5 specifically
(likely never completed -- the job was torn down while run 3 was still on
shape 2/5, in_proj_qkvz), were not saved and are not recoverable (the
Job's emptyDir volume was destroyed with the pod).


=== Second attempt: same job, rerun in full, all output saved this time ===

Same job yaml (real-tuner-repeat-m1024-job.yaml), rerun end-to-end after
the first attempt's data loss. This time the job was allowed to fully
complete (all 3 runs x all 5 shapes, confirmed "done, sleeping" reached),
and the ENTIRE tuned-configs-run1/2/3 directories (all 5 shapes each) were
`oc cp`'d to local disk -- see ./real-tuner-repeat-m1024-full-results/ --
before the job was deleted.

gate_up_proj (N=17408, K=5120) at M=1024, second attempt:
  run 1: GROUP_SIZE_M=64  (BLOCK_SIZE_M=128, BLOCK_SIZE_N=128, BLOCK_SIZE_K=128, num_warps=8, num_stages=3)
  run 2: GROUP_SIZE_M=64  (same other params)
  run 3: GROUP_SIZE_M=16  (same other params)

Combined across BOTH attempts (6 independent fresh full-search runs total):
  GROUP_SIZE_M values seen: 16, 32, 32, 16, 64, 64  -- i.e. 16 (x2), 32 (x2), 64 (x2)
  GROUP_SIZE_M=1 (the committed/historical value): 0/6

Roughly even coverage of all three grouped candidates, and STILL zero
occurrences of the committed GROUP_SIZE_M=1 across 6 tries -- strong,
repeated confirmation that the historical pick was an outlier of a noisy
process, not a typical or even moderately likely outcome.

Full 5-shape JSON files for the second attempt's 3 runs are saved in
./real-tuner-repeat-m1024-full-results/tuned-configs-run{1,2,3}/.
